config BR2_PACKAGE_MEMORY_GAME
	bool "memory_game"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_C_PERIPHERY
	help
	  Simple memory game using GPIO to interact with diodes and buttons.
	  Depends on c-periphery library.

	  https://github.com/kamil7430/raspberry-memory

comment "memory depends on periphery package"
	depends on !BR2_PACKAGE_C_PERIPHERY